# Archive masters for the showcase videos now live OUTSIDE the repo, at
# ~/Desktop/Projects/portfolio/video-originals/. They must never sit under
# src/assets/projects/: assetSafe() in components/portfolio/projectsData.tsx
# uses a template-literal require(), so webpack builds a context over that whole
# directory and emits every file in it, imported or not. 25 MB of archive video
# shipped to production that way.
